PETSELFTEST1
# V3-05 low battery and charging. "battery" steps stand in for the PMIC
# (status band + battery policy; samples every 2 s, debounced):
# 1) plugged in: TuanTuan eats electricity; 2) unplugged, then low: a yawn
# with the "charge me" bubble; 3) critical (< 8 %): safe shutdown through
# the sleep flow. A flat battery arms no wake alarm, so the "alarm" step
# brings the board back 30 s after the power-off (self-test wake: no
# morning, the host restores the board).
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect min:event=plugged 1
# expect min:anim=eat 1
# expect min:name=charge 1
# expect min:event=unplugged 1
# expect min:event=low 1
# expect min:anim=yawn 1
# expect min:name=yawn 1
# expect min:event=critical 1
# expect min:PET_BATTERY_SHUTDOWN 1
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_SHOWN 1
# expect min:wake=selftest 1
# expect min:battery=1 1
# expect min:armed=1 1
# expect min:woke_by_alarm=1 1
# expect min:reason=selftest_wake 1
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_POWEROFF_RETURNED 0
# expect none:skipped=pet_off 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect timescale 25
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
# TEST ONLY: battery sampling (2 s, so the debounce) and the reaction
# timers at 25 %. "twait" scales with it; the animations, the status band
# and the sleep flow stay real ("wait").
# Real speed: timescale 100 (selftest_report.py --timescale 100).
timescale 25
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle (Wi-Fi up, activated), not after a
# fixed 20 s; the pet toggle below still retries.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
# Baseline: on battery, half full (the USB boot reads "charging").
battery 60 0
twait 5000
wait 3000
mark begin
# 1) Plugged in (2 agreeing samples): eat electricity (3 s hold).
battery 60 1
twait 5000
wait 7000
# 2) Unplugged, then low (3 agreeing samples): yawn and the "charge me"
#    bubble (4 s hold).
battery 60 0
twait 5000
wait 3000
battery 15 0
twait 7000
wait 9000
# 3) Critical: sleep flow, PMIC off; the alarm brings the board back.
alarm 30
battery 5 0
twait 7000
wait 25000
end
